# Design first

Before any work in this repository, read `docs/DESIGN.md` in full. Follow it. Update it in the same PR as any change to behavior, schema, UI copy, APIs, settings, or wrangler config. CI (`scripts/check-design.mjs`) fails the PR if `src/`, `migrations/`, or wrangler config change and `docs/DESIGN.md` does not.

Hard safety rules:

- Do not place, cancel, or modify a real Robinhood order without the owner's explicit confirmation of that specific order.
- Leave `ALLOW_LIVE_TRADING` at `"0"` unless the owner clearly says to turn it on.
- Keep dev and prod separate (Workers, D1, R2, Access, tokens). Dev should not hold a live Robinhood token.
- Do not deploy to prod or change prod without the owner's explicit go-ahead.
- Mask account numbers to the last four characters everywhere.

The same rules are in `AGENTS.md`.
